|> My priest, in his his first trip to hell into Dispator. I got a messege
|> saying "your Brain aches. You die.."
|> 
|> What happened? and how do you prevent it?

Probably a monster cast a magic attack on you.  You must have had fairly
low hit points for this to kill you, since normally I don't think it does
all that much damage (the damage is related to the monster level).

To prevent it, I think you want to get magic resistance (eg: GDSM).
